# Start the full stack first: docker compose --profile app up -d --build

### Liveness (also used by the container HEALTHCHECK via `rust-services healthcheck`)
GET http://localhost:3000/health/live

### Readiness – database reachable from the container network
GET http://localhost:3000/health/ready

### Login against the containerized service
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "user@booking.local", "password": "user-password-123"}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
